sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Flutter Workspace STT
    participant D as Django Workspace WS
    participant W as STT Worker
    participant V as Volcengine ASR

    F->>D: start
    D->>W: start
    W->>V: connect(ws_url, Authorization)
    W->>V: full client request(appid/token/resource_id/audio/request)
    W-->>D: session_started
    D-->>F: session_started

    loop during meeting
        F->>D: audio_chunk(PCM16 base64)
        D->>W: audio_chunk
        W->>V: binary audio frame
        V-->>W: partial event
        W-->>D: partial_transcript
        D-->>F: partial_transcript
    end

    F->>D: stop
    D->>W: stop
    W->>V: last frame
    V-->>W: final event
    W-->>D: final_transcript
    D-->>F: final_transcript
    D->>D: persist transcript + update workspace context
    W->>V: close websocket
